{"seq":1,"slug":"fuel-cell-principle-application-modeling","title":"PEMFC/SOFC 燃料电池原理、技术路线与应用场景建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/green-hydrogen-electrolysis-fuel-cell-systems/fuel-cell-enduse-governance/fuel-cell-principle-application-modeling","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"pemfc-sofc-燃料电池原理-技术路线与应用场景建模\">PEMFC/SOFC 燃料电池原理、技术路线与应用场景建模</h1><p>把电解槽产出的氢再变回电，是绿氢价值链闭合的最后一环。燃料电池不是&quot;烧氢&quot;——它把化学能直接转成电能，绕开卡诺循环，因此理论效率上限远高于内燃机。但 PEMFC 与 SOFC 这两条主流路线在载流子、工作温度、燃料容忍度和系统边界上差异极大，工程建模的第一步不是选&quot;效率最高的&quot;，而是判断项目的<strong>负载形态、可用燃料和热需求</strong>更适合哪一条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>燃料电池的原理是电化学氧化还原。氢气在阳极被催化解离为质子与电子，质子穿过电解质膜，电子走外电路做功，两者在阴极与氧结合生成水。单个电池的理论电压由能斯特方程与吉布斯自由能决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = -\\frac{\\Delta G}{nF} = E^0 - \\frac{RT}{nF}\\ln\\frac{p_{H_2O}}{p_{H_2}\\,p_{O_2}^{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-